    "trigger_card_number": 51,
    "header_color": "yellow",
    "title": "第32课：消失的字母",
    "pages": [
      {
        "page": 1,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
          "1": "Pecat. Memecat.",
          "2": "Tatap. Menatap.",
          "3": "Kirim. Mengirim.",
          "4": "Susun. Menyusun."
        },
        "content": [
          "   Setelah kesalahan besar minggu lalu,",
          "   perusahaan memecat dua pekerja.",
          "   = 上周犯下严重错误后，公司",
          "     解雇了两名员工。",
          "",
          "卡片写的是 pecat，句中却是 memecat。",
          "p 字母彻底消失了。",
          "",
          "这条规则让词典很难用。meN- 前缀会",
          "吞掉四个字母，其余则保留不变：",
          "",
          "",
          "   p  ->  mem-   pecat    memecat        按 1",
          "   t  ->  men-   tatap    menatap        按 2",
          "   k  ->  meng-  kirim    mengirim       按 3",
          "   s  ->  meny-  susun    menyusun       按 4",
          "",
          "这四个字母消失，其他都保留。"
        ]
      },
      {
        "page": 2,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "content": [
          "   me-    l m n r w y   lacak  melacak",
          "   mem-   b f (p)       balas  membalas",
          "   men-   c d j (t)     cari   mencari",
          "   meng-  g h (k) 元音  urus   mengurus",
          "   meny-  (s)           susun  menyusun",
          "   menge- 单音节        cat    mengecat",
          "",
          "括号中的字母就是那四个会消失的。",
          "要倒推原词，先去掉前缀，再尝试",
          "括号里的字母：",
          "",
          "   memecat   ->  pecat，不是 ecat",
          "   menatap   ->  tatap，不是 atap",
          "   mengurus  ->  urus，这里没有 k",
          "",
          "若两种还原结果都是真词，",
          "就由句子决定，但这种情况很少。",
          "本卡包里没有哪个词会两次歧义。"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
